// Christof_7_4_240            Then truly we are lost. Our souls are beyond all hope of redemption.
// Anezka_7_4_241              Milord! Look thou, at the locket thou didst give me. 'Tis the locket of Saint Jude. The patron saint of lost causes.
// Christof_7_4_242            Thus fate makes a bitter mockery of our plight!
// Anezka_7_4_243              Say not so! Where the saints tread, hope follows. Mayhap Saint Jude shall bring us hope past all hope. I pray we find a way.
// Christof_7_4_244            I pray so too. Thy hopeful words have filled my heart with courage, and I can leave satisfied. Farewell, fair Anezka.
